# Copy to .env for local builds. Astro and Bun load it automatically.

# Public Cloudflare Turnstile site key for the contact form (safe to expose; it ends up in the page).
# If this is empty, the form uses Cloudflare's test key, which always passes the widget. That is
# fine for local work, but a real deployment must set the real key.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
